  Kinetic (Delta T^0):                   0.889464133768302         24.2036           558.15          2335.29
  Delta V^Pauli Coulomb:                -0.354335766851330         -9.6420          -222.35          -930.31
  Delta V^Pauli LDA-XC:                 -0.199365929074167         -5.4250          -125.10          -523.44
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Exchange:            0.035969655519345          0.9788            22.57            94.44
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Correlation:        -0.030832352522038         -0.8390           -19.35           -80.95
                                      --------------------     -----------       ----------      -----------
  Total Pauli Repulsion:                 0.340899740840113          9.2764           213.92           895.03
 (Total Pauli Repulsion =
  Delta E^Pauli in BB paper)

